OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Avoters want from their new MP?
OL,5,
OL,6,FVoters in Holborn and St Pancras are
OL,7,Fbeing courted by rival political
OL,8,Fparties ahead of a by-election that
OL,9,Fwill be seen as an early test for Sir
OL,10,FKeir Starmer's successor, Prime
OL,11,FMinister Andy Burnham.
OL,13,FThe contest was triggered when Sir
OL,14,FKeir, who had held the inner-London
OL,15,Fseat since 2015, resigned as an MP at
OL,16,Fthe start of September in what he said
OL,17,Fwas a move to focus on international
OL,18,Faffairs.
OL,20,FFor some residents of the constituency,
OL,21,Fthe priorities are close to home.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
