OL,3,GNEWSAWhat do Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Avoters want from their new MP?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNear King's Cross, Gaven Duffy, who has
OL,7,Flived in the constituency for 28 years,
OL,8,Ftold the BBC's Politics London
OL,9,Fprogramme he wants his next MP to focus
OL,10,Fon affordable housing.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
